    description = '<p>Start the session with Pumpkin Smile to wake the body. Smile like a Halloween smile on a pumpkin and then make your face as small as possible.</p><p><strong>Why it works</strong></p><ul><li>Releases tension before singing</li><li>Aligns posture for freer breath and tone</li><li>Gets the whole class moving as one ensemble</li></ul>',
