-- [Physical Starters] Gentle Shoulder Rolls
UPDATE activities
SET activity = 'Gentle Shoulder Rolls',
    time = 3,
    description = '<p>Start the session with Gentle Shoulder Rolls to wake the body. Do gentle shoulder rolls: try micro-circles and then bigger circles, both forward and back, first with each shoulder and then both together.</p><p><strong>Why it works</strong></p><ul><li>Releases tension before singing</li><li>Aligns posture for freer breath and tone</li><li>Checks alignment so the voice isn’t blocked</li></ul>',
