    description = '<p>Start the session with Rub Hands Together Wiggle Fingers And Shake to wake the body. Rub hands together, wiggle fingers and shake hands high and low.</p><p><strong>Why it works</strong></p><ul><li>Releases tension before singing</li><li>Aligns posture for freer breath and tone</li><li>Raises energy and group focus quickly</li></ul>',
