    time = 3,
    description = '<p>Start the session with Arm Circles to wake the body. With both arms held out in front of them, draw small circles getting gradually bigger.</p><p><strong>Why it works</strong></p><ul><li>Releases tension before singing</li><li>Aligns posture for freer breath and tone</li><li>Gets the whole class moving as one ensemble</li></ul>',
