    description = '<p>Warm the face and diction with Mama Made Me Mash M''n''M''s. Sing the phrase ‘Mama made me mash my m’n’m’s’ on a monotone gradually rising in pitch up a scale.</p><p><strong>Why it works</strong></p><ul><li>Wakes facial muscles for clear diction</li><li>Improves articulation without forcing the voice</li><li>Makes warm-up playful so diction feels low-stakes</li></ul>',
    activity_text = '<p><strong>Setup</strong></p><p>Standing or seated circle so everyone can see mouths. No props needed. About 2 minutes.</p><p><strong>How to do it</strong></p><ol><li>Gather focus and watch the teacher model once in silence.</li><li>Sing the phrase ‘Mama made me mash my m’n’m’s’ on a monotone gradually rising in pitch up a scale.</li><li>Repeat together, then try once more with greater clarity.</li></ol><p><strong>Teacher tips</strong></p><ul><li>Give a clear starting pitch each repeat of Mama Made Me Mash M''n''M''s; if top notes shout, narrow to a gentle ‘ng’ slide first.</li><li>For Mama Made Me Mash M''n''M''s, contrast a muddy version with a crystal-clear version so the diction target is obvious.</li><li>Land Mama Made Me Mash M''n''M''s on a whispered clear sentence, then the same sentence sung.</li></ul><p><strong>Make it easier</strong></p><p>Speak the pattern slowly in unison before any pitch or speed challenge.</p><p><strong>Make it harder</strong></p><p>Siren through a wider interval, then land softly on a sung ‘ah’.</p><p><strong>Extension</strong></p><p>Drop the warm-up consonants into a tricky lyric from the song.</p>',
    updated_at = NOW()
WHERE id = 'f2e7cf3c-b59c-4bff-b311-9f9024b3f75f';

-- [Facial Warm-Ups / Diction] Mama Mini M and M's
UPDATE activities
SET activity = 'Mama Mini M and M''s',
