    time = 3,
    description = '<p>Explore pitch and listening with Zinger. Sing the word ‘Zinger’ to the notes 5, 4, 3, 2 of the scale finishing with a ‘zing’ on notes 1, 5, 1.</p><p><strong>Why it works</strong></p><ul><li>Explores pitch range safely and playfully</li><li>Builds listening and pitch-matching accuracy</li><li>Smooths register transitions without pushing</li></ul>',
