    description = '<p>Explore pitch and listening with Scale Pattern with Clap. Sing up and down as follows: 1 121 12321 1234321 etc.</p><p><strong>Why it works</strong></p><ul><li>Explores pitch range safely and playfully</li><li>Builds listening and pitch-matching accuracy</li><li>Smooths register transitions without pushing</li></ul>',
