SET activity_text = '<p><strong>Setup</strong></p><p>Clear floor space for movement. No props needed. About 10 minutes.</p><p><strong>How to play</strong></p><ol><li>One child (detective) turns away while teacher chooses secret ''tagger''</li><li>Tagger winks at classmates who dramatically fall down</li><li>Detective guesses the tagger</li></ol><p><strong>Teacher tips</strong></p><ul><li>Remind taggers to use gentle contact or a clear wink — no pushing or chasing into furniture.</li><li>Keep Wink Detective to two short rounds; stop while faces are still bright and name one clear success.</li><li>Name one precise success after Wink Detective (‘clear freeze’, ‘brave offer’) before you reset.</li></ul><p><strong>Make it easier</strong></p><p>Teacher models first; children copy as a whole group before trying in pairs.</p><p><strong>Make it harder</strong></p><p>Add a second cue (speed, size or emotion) once the basic game is secure.</p>',
