-- Drama tip refresh: Firing Line Word Snap
UPDATE activities
SET activity_text = '<p><strong>Setup</strong></p><p>Open floor space. Work in small groups. No props needed. About 10 minutes.</p><p><strong>How to play</strong></p><ol><li>In small groups, one child is ''Goalie''. Others ''fire'' words (e.g</li><li>''ocean'') and goalie responds quickly with associated word (e.g. ''fish'')</li></ol><p><strong>Teacher tips</strong></p><ul><li>Before Firing Line Word Snap, model the first ten seconds yourself so the rule is visible, not only explained.</li><li>Keep Firing Line Word Snap to two short rounds; stop while faces are still bright and name one clear success.</li><li>Name one precise success after Firing Line Word Snap (‘clear freeze’, ‘brave offer’) before you reset.</li></ul><p><strong>Make it easier</strong></p><p>Teacher models first; children copy as a whole group before trying in pairs.</p><p><strong>Make it harder</strong></p><p>Add a second cue (speed, size or emotion) once the basic game is secure.</p>',
    updated_at = NOW()
WHERE id = 'a498f2a2-e549-4f26-9083-9ee86c8e1eb8';

-- Drama tip refresh: Cloud Sculptures
UPDATE activities
SET activity_text = '<p><strong>Setup</strong></p><p>Clear floor space for movement. Props: optional music player. About 10 minutes.</p><p><strong>How to play</strong></p><ol><li>Form ''cloud'' shapes with bodies; freeze when music stops</li><li>Explore different cloud types (fluffy, stormy, wispy)</li></ol><p><strong>Teacher tips</strong></p><ul><li>Use one sharp freeze cue for Cloud Sculptures; hold three silent counts before you speak so stillness sticks.</li><li>Keep tracks short and fade early so freezes land on silence, not a long outro.</li><li>Scan the edges of the room in Cloud Sculptures and bring a quieter pupil in to lead the next micro-round.</li></ul><p><strong>Make it easier</strong></p><p>Teacher models first; children copy as a whole group before trying in pairs.</p><p><strong>Make it harder</strong></p><p>Add a second cue (speed, size or emotion) once the basic game is secure.</p>',
    updated_at = NOW()
WHERE id = 'fae9df2c-fe37-41be-9fea-273d0a7923e5';

-- Drama tip refresh: Parade of Animals
UPDATE activities
SET activity_text = '<p><strong>Setup</strong></p><p>Clear floor space for movement. No props needed. About 15 minutes.</p><p><strong>How to play</strong></p><ol><li>On call, children walk and sound like animals, pausing and changing on cues</li><li>Include farm animals, zoo animals, pets</li></ol><p><strong>Teacher tips</strong></p><ul><li>Choose animals the class knows; cue changes with a clear word so transitions stay sharp, not chaotic.</li><li>Keep Parade of Animals to two short rounds; stop while faces are still bright and name one clear success.</li><li>Scan the edges of the room in Parade of Animals and bring a quieter pupil in to lead the next micro-round.</li></ul><p><strong>Make it easier</strong></p><p>Teacher models first; children copy as a whole group before trying in pairs.</p><p><strong>Make it harder</strong></p><p>Layer dynamics (loud/soft, near/far) and keep a shared pulse.</p><p><strong>Extension</strong></p><p>Choose animals from a class topic or story.</p>',
    updated_at = NOW()
WHERE id = '507b0b0d-cc2a-4add-aba6-9529b0b0068d';

-- Drama tip refresh: Silent Orchestra
UPDATE activities
SET activity_text = '<p><strong>Setup</strong></p><p>Clear floor space for movement. Props: optional music player. About 15 minutes.</p><p><strong>How to play</strong></p><ol><li>Children act as musical instruments using body sounds</li><li>Include conductor cues for loud/soft, fast/slow</li></ol><p><strong>Teacher tips</strong></p><ul><li>Layer one sound at a time; conductor cuts with a flat hand so the texture doesn’t turn to noise.</li><li>Keep Silent Orchestra to two short rounds; stop while faces are still bright and name one clear success.</li><li>Name one precise success after Silent Orchestra (‘clear freeze’, ‘brave offer’) before you reset.</li></ul><p><strong>Make it easier</strong></p><p>Teacher models first; children copy as a whole group before trying in pairs.</p><p><strong>Make it harder</strong></p><p>Layer dynamics (loud/soft, near/far) and keep a shared pulse.</p>',
    updated_at = NOW()
WHERE id = 'cdbd006b-ce55-4c7e-9ed2-692a0bf2e8b3';

