-- Drama tip refresh: Freeze-Frame Stories
UPDATE activities
SET activity_text = '<p><strong>Setup</strong></p><p>Open floor space. Work in small groups. No props needed. About 15 minutes.</p><p><strong>How to play</strong></p><ol><li>Small groups freeze into scene from story (e.g. lost in forest)</li><li>Hold 5-10 seconds, then explain what''s happening</li></ol><p><strong>Teacher tips</strong></p><ul><li>Use one sharp freeze cue for Freeze-Frame Stories; hold three silent counts before you speak so stillness sticks.</li><li>For Freeze-Frame Stories, allow one planning whisper only; then commit — stop the scene solely for safety or a clear reset.</li><li>If Freeze-Frame Stories frays, shrink the group size for one round, then rebuild to whole class.</li></ul><p><strong>Make it easier</strong></p><p>Reduce choices and model the first round together.</p><p><strong>Make it harder</strong></p><p>Require a clear beginning, middle and end within the time limit.</p><p><strong>Extension</strong></p><p>Bring one statue to life for five seconds, then freeze again.</p>',
    updated_at = NOW()
WHERE id = '38dc7bad-0e25-417e-b367-e56665b8f706';

-- Drama tip refresh: Wrong Names
UPDATE activities
SET activity_text = '<p><strong>Setup</strong></p><p>Clear space so the class can sit or stand in a circle. No props needed. About 10 minutes.</p><p><strong>How to play</strong></p><ol><li>Teacher says a name; child must respond with a different name</li><li>Continue rapidly around circle</li></ol><p><strong>Teacher tips</strong></p><ul><li>Before Wrong Names, model the first ten seconds yourself so the rule is visible, not only explained.</li><li>After Wrong Names, ask for one concrete example of good listening or a bold offer before you reset.</li><li>Name one precise success after Wrong Names (‘clear freeze’, ‘brave offer’) before you reset.</li></ul><p><strong>Make it easier</strong></p><p>Reduce choices and model the first round together.</p><p><strong>Make it harder</strong></p><p>Add a time limit, a second rule, or ask pairs to share one polished moment.</p>',
    updated_at = NOW()
WHERE id = '942f5cc3-f219-480b-a1cd-6a147a4cb18e';

-- Drama tip refresh: Sound Picture
UPDATE activities
SET activity_text = '<p><strong>Setup</strong></p><p>Clear floor space for movement. No props needed. About 15 minutes.</p><p><strong>How to play</strong></p><ol><li>Choose setting (market, sea)</li><li>One child starts with sound; each adds layer (seagulls, waves), building soundscape</li></ol><p><strong>Teacher tips</strong></p><ul><li>Layer one sound at a time; conductor cuts with a flat hand so the texture doesn’t turn to noise.</li><li>After Sound Picture, ask for one concrete example of good listening or a bold offer before you reset.</li><li>Name one precise success after Sound Picture (‘clear freeze’, ‘brave offer’) before you reset.</li></ul><p><strong>Make it easier</strong></p><p>Reduce choices and model the first round together.</p><p><strong>Make it harder</strong></p><p>Layer dynamics (loud/soft, near/far) and keep a shared pulse.</p><p><strong>Extension</strong></p><p>Perform the soundscape under a short narrated story.</p>',
    updated_at = NOW()
WHERE id = '4bf6aea5-8cbc-4bef-a3c5-2a1a8e54f9c8';

-- Drama tip refresh: One-Word Story
