-- Drama tip refresh: Mirror Scenes
UPDATE activities
SET activity_text = '<p><strong>Setup</strong></p><p>Clear floor space. Children work in pairs. No props needed. About 15 minutes.</p><p><strong>How to play</strong></p><ol><li>Ask the class to find a partner and face each other with a little space around them.</li><li>In pairs, pupils create short, mirrored scenes where they copy each other''s actions in real-time to tell a short story (e.g. getting ready in the morning).</li><li>Play a second round with a fresh prompt, then share one strong moment with the class.</li></ol><p><strong>Teacher tips</strong></p><ul><li>If leaders race, freeze the pair and restart in exaggerated slow motion so mirrors can match.</li><li>In Mirror Scenes, swap leaders halfway so both partners make offers, not just the confident one.</li><li>Name one precise success after Mirror Scenes (‘clear freeze’, ‘brave offer’) before you reset.</li></ul><p><strong>Make it easier</strong></p><p>Work as a whole class first, then try with a partner.</p><p><strong>Make it harder</strong></p><p>Require a clear beginning, middle and end within the time limit.</p>',
    updated_at = NOW()
WHERE id = 'a906ce67-b40c-4dee-a08b-3db853edfd69';

