-- Drama tip refresh: Find the Prop
UPDATE activities
SET activity_text = '<p><strong>Setup</strong></p><p>Clear floor space for movement. Props: a few simple props (scarf, hat, cup). About 15 minutes.</p><p><strong>How to play</strong></p><ol><li>Place a variety of simple props (e.g. a scarf, a hat, a plastic cup) in the centre</li><li>Pupils take turns choosing a prop and using it to tell a short story or become a character</li></ol><p><strong>Teacher tips</strong></p><ul><li>Before Find the Prop, model the first ten seconds yourself so the rule is visible, not only explained.</li><li>After Find the Prop, ask for one concrete example of good listening or a bold offer before you reset.</li><li>If Find the Prop frays, shrink the group size for one round, then rebuild to whole class.</li></ul><p><strong>Make it easier</strong></p><p>Reduce choices and model the first round together.</p><p><strong>Make it harder</strong></p><p>Require a clear beginning, middle and end within the time limit.</p>',
    updated_at = NOW()
