-- Drama tip refresh: Freeze and Swap
UPDATE activities
SET activity_text = '<p><strong>Setup</strong></p><p>Clear floor space for movement. No props needed. About 15 minutes.</p><p><strong>How to play</strong></p><ol><li>Two pupils are improvising a scene</li><li>The teacher shouts ''Freeze!'' and tags one of the pupils</li><li>A third student takes their place, repeating the frozen pose, and then continues the scene with a completely new idea</li></ol><p><strong>Teacher tips</strong></p><ul><li>Use one sharp freeze cue for Freeze and Swap; hold three silent counts before you speak so stillness sticks.</li><li>For Freeze and Swap, allow one planning whisper only; then commit — stop the scene solely for safety or a clear reset.</li><li>If Freeze and Swap frays, shrink the group size for one round, then rebuild to whole class.</li></ul><p><strong>Make it easier</strong></p><p>Give a clearer prompt or allow a short planning whisper before performing.</p><p><strong>Make it harder</strong></p><p>Require a clear beginning, middle and end within the time limit.</p><p><strong>Extension</strong></p><p>Replay the strongest 20 seconds and polish one offer.</p>',
    updated_at = NOW()
WHERE id = '00eec09a-fdea-428d-8f6f-2653a1eb7537';

