SET activity_text = '<p><strong>Setup</strong></p><p>Clear space so the class can sit or stand in a circle. Props: one everyday object. About 15 minutes.</p><p><strong>How to play</strong></p><ol><li>Pupils sit in a circle and are given a mundane object (e.g., a stick)</li><li>They must pass the object around, but each person must use it as if it is a different, new object (e.g., a sword, a microphone)</li></ol><p><strong>Teacher tips</strong></p><ul><li>Keep the circle tight enough to hear; if the pass breaks, rewind two people and restart the chain.</li><li>After Pass the Prop, ask for one concrete example of good listening or a bold offer before you reset.</li><li>Scan the edges of the room in Pass the Prop and bring a quieter pupil in to lead the next micro-round.</li></ul><p><strong>Make it easier</strong></p><p>Give a clearer prompt or allow a short planning whisper before performing.</p><p><strong>Make it harder</strong></p><p>Raise the challenge with constraints (no words, fixed emotion, or a tighter time limit).</p>',
